  "plain": "A man named Carlos Dosoza, speaking to a podcast host, Jesse Michels, in an episode about a hospital said to have operated on an alien, describes a site near the town of Varginha, Brazil, in 1996 where a craft is said to have crashed. He says the tree the ship ran into was \"burnt to a crisp\", and the story speaks of a bare, stretched-out circle on the ground. He mentions a woman named Claudia Kovu, and he tells it as physical traces left behind by the crash."
